   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-5-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla la matriz \\(X\\) que verifica la igualdad \\(AXA^{-1}+B=CA^{-1}\\) sabiendo que \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\-1&-3&0\\\\1&4&1\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&2\\\\0&0&-1\\\\1&0&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(BA=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&-1\\\\-1&-5&-3\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Multiplico los dos miembros por \\(A\\) por la derecha<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Así aparece \\(BA\\), que es el dato, y desaparece \\(A^{-1}\\): \\(AXA^{-1}A=AX\\).</i>:</p>\\[AXA^{-1}+B=CA^{-1}\\iff AX+BA=C\\iff AX=C-BA\\iff X=A^{-1}(C-BA)\\]<p>Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\-1&-3&0\\\\1&4&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+1\\bigr)\\]\\[=-1\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 1 & -1\\\\1 & 0 & -1\\\\0 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=-\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 0\\\\-1 & -1 & -1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & -1 & 0\\\\-1 & 0 & 0\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[C-BA=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1 & 2\\\\0 & 0 & -1\\\\1 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 1 & -1\\\\-1 & -5 & -3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & -2 & 2\\\\-1 & -1 & 0\\\\2 & 5 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & -1 & 0\\\\-1 & 0 & 0\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & -2 & 2\\\\-1 & -1 & 0\\\\2 & 5 & 2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -5 & 6\\\\0 & 2 & -2\\\\1 & 2 & 4\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -5 & 6\\\\0 & 2 & -2\\\\1 & 2 & 4\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ecmat",
