  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-5-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}\\lambda x+\\lambda y+\\lambda z=0\\\\\\lambda x+2y+2z=0\\\\\\lambda x+2y+z=0\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Discute el sistema según los valores de \\(\\lambda\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Determina, si existen, los valores de \\(\\lambda\\) para los que el sistema tiene alguna solución en la que \\(z\\neq0\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es homogéneo: siempre es compatible (\\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\))<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&\\lambda&\\lambda\\\\\\lambda&2&2\\\\\\lambda&2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(2 \\lambda+2 \\lambda^{2}+2 \\lambda^{2}\\bigr)-\\bigl(2 \\lambda^{2}+4 \\lambda+\\lambda^{2}\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\lambda^2-2\\lambda=\\lambda(\\lambda-2)\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq0,2\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3\\). <b>Compatible determinado</b> (solo la solución nula).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&0\\\\0&2&2\\\\0&2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\), con \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&2\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-2\\neq0\\): rango 2. <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=2\\)<b>:</b> \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&2&2\\\\2&2&2\\\\2&2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\), con \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&2\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-2\\neq0\\) (filas 2 y 3, columnas 2 y 3): rango 2. <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq0,2\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(\\lambda=0\\) o \\(\\lambda=2\\): compatible indeterminado</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq0,2\\) la única solución es la nula (\\(z=0\\)). Miro los otros dos casos:</p><p><b>• </b>\\(\\lambda=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(2y+2z=0\\) y \\(2y+z=0\\). Restando, \\(z=0\\) (e \\(y=0\\), con \\(x\\) libre).</p><p><b>• </b>\\(\\lambda=2\\)<b>:</b> \\(2x+2y+2z=0\\) y \\(2x+2y+z=0\\). Restando, \\(z=0\\) (con \\(x=-y\\)).</p><div class='res'>No existe ningún \\(\\lambda\\): en todos los casos las soluciones tienen \\(z=0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
