   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(r\\) a paramétricas: con \\(x=t\\), \\(y=-2t\\), \\(z=0\\). Un punto de \\(r\\) es \\(C(t,-2t,0)\\). El ángulo en \\(A\\) es recto si \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=0\\):</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(2,0,2),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(t,\\,-2t-1,\\,-1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=2t-2=0\\iff t=1\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-150,\"el\":38,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-1.5,3.0,0.0],[1.5,-3.0,0.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.5,-3.0,0.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[0,1,1],[2,1,3],[1,-2,0]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0.283,1.0,1.283],[0.403,0.638,1.162],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.403,0.638,1.162],[0.121,0.638,0.879],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[0,1,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2,1,3],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,-2,0],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 238' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m15r5b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m15r5b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m15r5b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m15r5b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='173.5' x2='314.0' y2='184.1' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='184.1' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><polygon points='132.8,131.6 175.8,18.0 266.0,182.3' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='138.8' 